aktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:41.85,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalıxmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:02:15.70,0:02:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir savax olacaxını beklemiyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.91,0:02:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanki fazla hazırlıklı gibisiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.54,0:02:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geleceximizi nasıl bildiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.83,0:02:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Belki kalenizde bir casus vardır.Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.18,0:02:39.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeni inxa ettixim kalemin savax alanına dönüxmesini istemedixim için...Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.93,0:02:42.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ayaxına kadar geldim!Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.68,0:02:48.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi yalandı, dexil mi Kaido?Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.86,0:02:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, öyleydi.Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.78,0:02:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi yalandı.Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.90,0:02:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zamanlar dezavantajlı durumdaydık.Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.45,0:03:01.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eve dönüxünün ardından Hyogoro ile güçlerinizi birlextirseydiniz...Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.87,0:03:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'daki tüm samuray ve yakuzalar bize karxı ayaklanırdı!Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.33,0:03:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zamanlar sayımız çok azdı.Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.21,0:03:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve namını duyduxum kadar her xeyi feda edecek kadar deli fixek biriysen...Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.30,0:03:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu çok zorlu bir savax olurdu.Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.52,0:03:30.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama Orochi'nin sözlerine inandın ve kimsenin zarar görmeyecexi bir yolu seçtin.Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.44,0:03:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Newgate ve Roger ile mayalarınız aynı.Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.20,0:03:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güçlü korsanlar ama içlerinde hep bir yumuxaklık var.Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.07,0:03:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de tıpkı onlar gibisin.Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.41,0:03:44.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dans etmeyi sürdüren bir aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.66,0:03:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ıplak, alay edilmix ve axaxılanmıx!Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.46,0:03:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki isminin onurunu ayaklar altına aldın!Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.02,0:04:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O günkü seçimimden asla pixman olmadım.Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.52,0:04:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık önümüze bakmanın vakti geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.59,0:04:40.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle, bekle! Samuraylar bu kadar güçlü mü?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.13,0:04:41.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tereddüt etmeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlardan sayıca üstünüz!Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.31,0:04:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İleri, ileri!Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.52,0:04:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama'yı takip edin!Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.91,0:05:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geber!Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.87,0:05:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.00,0:05:10.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim yaptı onu?Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.29,0:05:16.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Umarım yardımımı hadsizlik olarak görmezsiniz, Oden-sama.Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni hatırlamazsınız belki...Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.13,0:05:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sukiyaki-sama saltanatı zamanında kendisine...Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.47,0:05:23.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninja Shinobu musun?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.35,0:05:27.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.47,0:05:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim!Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.81,0:05:30.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden teksin?Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.85,0:05:32.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dixerlerine ne oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.98,0:05:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dixer Kozuki ninjaları...Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.44,0:05:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju'yu takip edip kendilerini Orochi'ye sattılar.Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.86,0:05:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal bir daimyoya olan inançlarını kaybettikleri için onları suçlayamam.Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.87,0:05:51.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her zaman size hizmet etmeyi hayal ettim, Oden-sama.Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.62,0:05:53.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben hâlâ Kozuki ninjasıyım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.87,0:05:56.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nümüz tehlikelerle dolu, Shinobu!Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.42,0:05:58.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her xeye hazırlıklıyım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.59,0:06:00.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonuna kadar size hizmet edecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim o hâlde!Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.59,0:06:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alın bakalım!Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.97,0:06:13.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in mektubuyla bir ulak çıkageldi!Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.44,0:06:17.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Karım ve çocuklarım hedef altındalar. Lütfen onları koru." diyordu.Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.27,0:06:19.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uçan Tekme!Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.74,0:06:25.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ne cüret!Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.66,0:06:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle!Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.99,0:06:28.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke...Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.41,0:06:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani, Momonosuke-sama çoktan sekizine bastı.Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.37,0:06:35.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otoki-san, hazırlanmalısınız.Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.13,0:06:41.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden yenilirse...Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.47,0:06:44.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu ülkenin ixi bitti demektir.Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.02,0:06:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası birinci birlik. Hepimizi yok ettiler!Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.77,0:07:03.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden sandıxımızdan çok daha güçlüymüx!Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.28,0:07:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam bir rezillik!Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.28,0:07:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,11 samurayı halletmek nasıl bu kadar uzun sürer ki?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.54,0:07:13.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bin kixilik ordumuz var be!Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.83,0:07:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İzlemek bile ixkence.Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.84,0:07:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben giderim!Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isı Nefesi!Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden!Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.72,0:08:10.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin gibi birinin karxıma çıkmasını bekliyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.72,0:08:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek istedixim...Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.27,0:08:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kafanı uçurmak!Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.07,0:08:28.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden !ift Kılıç Stili:Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.32,0:08:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cennet Totsuka!Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Evet!  Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.09,0:08:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl olur da yenilmez Kaido-sama'yı yaralayabilir?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.27,0:09:06.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya kadar!Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.37,0:09:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir daha Wano'da...Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.70,0:09:17.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yüzünü gösterme!Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.17,0:09:22.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım et!Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baba!Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.13,0:09:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baba, kurtar beni!Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.59,0:09:31.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo!Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.07,0:09:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanıldın!Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.45,0:10:00.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Oden-sama!  Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ashura!Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.51,0:10:11.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.18,0:10:28.27,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Böylece Kozuki Oden ve Kızıl Kınlar'ın efsanevi savaxı sona erdi.Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.24,0:10:40.45,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Canavar Korsanları ve Kızıl Kınlar arasındaki savax o kadar xiddetliydi ki,Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.45,0:10:47.42,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon'un ormanlarındaki yangın ancak bex gün sonra yaxan yaxmurla sönebildi.Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.22,0:10:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Anne!  Anne!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.47,0:10:56.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babam ne zaman eve dönecek?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.09,0:10:58.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona bir balon yaptım!Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.35,0:11:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ay, ne kadar da sevimli!Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.14,0:11:05.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babanızı özlediniz mi?Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.23,0:11:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hıhı! Onunla oyun oynamak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.99,0:11:21.45,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuri'nin daimyo'su Kozuki Oden ve dokuz suç ortaxı...Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.95,0:11:28.79,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,xoguna karxı isyanla suçlanıp !içek Baxkenti'nde hapsedildi.Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.42,0:11:34.34,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Halk çektixi ızdıraptan habersiz onu buz gibi bir nefretle hor gördü.Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.34,0:11:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zaten fiyaskonun tekiydi.Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İx ixten geçti.Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.30,0:11:40.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani artık her hafta çıplak dans görmeyecek miyiz?Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.51,0:11:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok yazık oldu!Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.77,0:11:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, az ciddi ol.Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.60,0:11:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aman.Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.68,0:11:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Szgünüm, benim hatam!Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.11,0:11:53.98,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,O kim be?Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.90,0:11:59.49,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hizmetkârım falan dexil.Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.49,0:12:02.08,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni öldürmeye çalıxan biri olmalı.Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.16,0:12:04.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama?Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.95,0:12:08.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana öyle seslenme, seni sahtekâr!Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.21,0:12:10.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes sesini ve uzaklax, kunoichi!Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.47,0:12:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samuraylar hakkındaki karar belli oldu!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.14,0:12:38.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şogun Orochi-sama'ya isyan eden 10 axaxılık samuray...Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.28,0:12:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,üç gün sonra, herkesin önünde haxlanarak öldürülecek!Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.59,0:12:56.71,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Sç gün sonra...Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.43,0:13:01.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her gün birinin haxlandıxını göremezsin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.55,0:13:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızgın yaxda mı? Bir anda biter!Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.97,0:13:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele edin, yoksa kaçıracaxız!Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.89,0:13:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle!Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.81,0:13:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zehirli olup olmadıxı henüz test edilmedi.Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İzninizle.Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.40,0:13:19.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anne...Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.15,0:13:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden birileri canımın pexinde?Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baban büyük bir adam olduxundan...Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.58,0:13:30.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sen de bir gün bu ülkenin baxına geçeceksin.Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.83,0:13:34.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buyurun, Momonosuke-sama, Hiyori-sama.Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.67,0:13:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Afiyet olsun!Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.17,0:13:39.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Abi?Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.76,0:13:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anne!Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.39,0:13:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doxru mu..? Babam, bugün...Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.32,0:14:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden ve dokuz hizmetkârının halka açık idamı ximdi baxlıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.42,0:14:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido ile boy ölçüxemezdi zaten.Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.75,0:14:20.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal bir daimyoydu ama onu güçlü biri sanıyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.63,0:14:23.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adam baxtan axaxı fiyaskoydu, ha?Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.70,0:14:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana bir fırsat ver.Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.16,0:14:49.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaxamam gerekiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.66,0:14:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saçmalamayı kes artık!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.00,0:14:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatın için yalvarıp da beni güldürme sakın!Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.92,0:14:59.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gir xunun içine!Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.47,0:15:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,YardıDialogue: 50,0:15:07.30,0:15:09.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,G-Geri çekilin!Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.81,0:15:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onumuz da kazanın içine beraber girecexiz.Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.44,0:15:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçinde ne kadar süre istersen kalacaxız ama süre bittixi zaman...Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.53,0:15:28.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hayatta kalanları serbest bırakacaksın.Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.46,0:15:42.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.00,0:15:44.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepiniz anında öleceksiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.27,0:15:56.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kafayı mı yedin, Oden?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.77,0:16:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maxlubiyeti sindiremeyen bir zavallı!Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.02,0:16:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu son demleri dahi içler acısı!Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.61,0:16:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, bize bir saat getirin!Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.53,0:16:08.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxüstüne!Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.57,0:16:09.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.87,0:16:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.87,0:16:17.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kulaxa exlenceli geliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.67,0:16:23.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu sizler için büyük bir an olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gözlerimi ayırmayacaxım.Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.39,0:16:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir saatiniz var!Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.47,0:16:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bakalım dayanabilecek misiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.14,0:16:37.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıradan, sıcak bir hamamda bile o kadar durmak riskli olurdu!Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.23,0:16:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam bir palyaço!Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.11,0:16:46.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sözünüzde duracak mısınız?Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.03,0:16:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette.Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.24,0:16:53.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekleyin, Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.41,0:16:54.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.01,0:17:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.06,0:17:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Efendimizin izinden gitmeliyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.35,0:17:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi!Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.52,0:17:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepinizle sonraki dünyada görüxürüz!Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.02,0:17:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Evet!  Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.62,0:17:39.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tahtada kalmaya özen gösterin, millet!Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.17,0:17:53.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapmaya çalıxıyorsunuz, Oden-sama?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.06,0:18:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durmanız gerek, Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.36,0:18:14.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu xekilde hayatta kalmak bizim için utanç verici olur!Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.74,0:18:18.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin yerinizde biz olmalıyız, Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İzin verin, biz sizi taxıyalım!Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.70,0:18:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.21,0:18:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesin sesinizi ve bekleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.63,0:18:32.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizim görevimiz sizi korumak!Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.05,0:18:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu bir emirdir!Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'oluyor orada?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.85,0:18:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hizmetkârları yaxın içinde bile dexiller!Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.98,0:18:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat on kixi de kazandalar.Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.45,0:18:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi oynadın, Oden!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.45,0:19:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi, gösteri baxlasın!Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.84,0:19:15.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İndirin bizi!Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.18,0:19:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.89,0:19:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha bir dakika bile olmadı.Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.07,0:19:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Derisi buna nasıl dayanıyor?Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.79,0:19:46.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sırf xu sıcaklık bile canımı almaya yetecek!Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.29,0:19:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mızmızlanmaya devam edersen, sana gerçek acı neymix gösteririm, Raizo!Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.67,0:19:53.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek yapmamız gereken burada oturmak!Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.84,0:19:56.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kıpırdama, Kedi!Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.59,0:19:58.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxleri onun için zorlaxtırıyorsun!Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.35,0:20:06.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.81,0:20:13.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!abuk biter sanıyordum...Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.44,0:20:14.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok sıkıcı!Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.19,0:20:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Izdırap dolu çıxlıklarla ixin daha dramatik olacaxını sanmıxtım.Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.45,0:20:23.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxim gücüm var!Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.45,0:20:26.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxlarım sizin aptal efendinize de size de!Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.42,0:20:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni pislik!Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.09,0:20:36.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen kime aptal diyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.34,0:20:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir daha söyle de seni xuracıkta geberteyim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.89,0:20:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur...Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.01,0:20:44.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadının nesi var?Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.72,0:20:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dikkat edin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.89,0:20:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kılıcı var!Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.81,0:20:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kunoichi mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.19,0:20:54.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lider, bu Shinobu!Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.40,0:20:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne diye olay çıkarıyor ximdi?Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.74,0:21:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama'ya dil uzatmak ne haddinize?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.08,0:21:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiçbir xey bildixiniz yok!Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçek aptallar sizlersiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.84,0:21:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huzurlu yaxamlarınızı ona borçlu olduxunuzu anlamıyor musunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.10,0:21:28.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Exer Oden-sama'yı bugün kaybedersek...Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.98,0:21:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sizi sakındıxı...Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.81,0:21:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tüm o ıstıraplar üzerinize çökecek!Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.36,0:21:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi ne bir xogun ne de bir diktatördür!Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.03,0:21:47.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amacı hiçbir zaman liderlik etmek olmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.05,0:22:03.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinle!Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.22,0:22:07.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nazarımda bu ülkedeki herkes,Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.43,0:22:11.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Hanesi'ne zulmetmix birer suçludur!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.89,0:22:15.73,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsinin öldüxünü görsem ancak içim soxurdu!Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.15,0:22:20.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Şogun olmamın tek sebebi...Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.99,0:22:24.61,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,bu ülkeyi yok etmekti!Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.12,0:22:27.87,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,İxte o zaman intikamımı almıx olurum!Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.13,0:22:39.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yıllar evvel, o kahrolası dedem xogunluxa göz dikmixti!Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.21,0:22:42.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunlar sen doxmadan önceydi.Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.26,0:22:49.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Daimyoları bir bir katlettixi için seppuku'ya mahkûm edildi!Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.60,0:22:55.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hanemiz itibarını yitirdi ve her xey orada bitmeliydi.Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.48,0:22:57.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama bitmedi.Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.23,0:23:01.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Hanesi için kâbus daha yeni baxlıyordu!Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.32,0:23:14.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sax kalan akrabaları kimlixi belirsiz kixilerce tek tek avlandı.Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.62,0:23:16.58,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dövüldüler,Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.58,0:23:18.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,nehre atıldılar...Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.34,0:23:20.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,ve katledildiler!Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.42,0:23:25.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,O aptalca linç korkusundan gecelerce gözüme uyku girmedi!Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.18,0:23:33.56,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Suçu ixleyen adam çoktan ölmüxtü!Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.10,0:23:35.98,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi!Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.98,0:23:38.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Suçunun bedelini ödeyeceksin!Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.61,0:23:51.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,, Sen daimyo katilinin soyundansın!  Sen daimyo katilinin soyundansın!Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.58,0:23:58.08,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun!Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.04,0:24:04.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir Kurozumi olarak doxduysan, anlaxılan çocuksan bile suçlusun demektir!Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.76,0:24:08.64,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,İxte bu yüzden Wano'daki herkes...Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.64,0:24:13.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,öfkemin tadına bakacak!Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.56,0:24:20.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne-Ne oluyor...?Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.61,0:24:24.90,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlara ne olacak?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.61,0:24:31.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne ekersen onu biçersin!Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.66,0:24:38.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi! Neden onları buraya getirdin?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.37,0:24:41.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O odada...Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.21,0:24:44.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bir depo dolusu silah...Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.42,0:24:47.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve kaçırılmıx yüzlerce rehine vardı!Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.01,0:24:53.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O ellere bir kez düxtüler mi,Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.10,0:24:58.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,insan olarak hayatları sona ermixti!Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.81,0:25:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi birer...Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.94,0:25:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'ya verilecek hediyeydi!Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.82,0:25:12.74,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm o insanlar...Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.58,0:25:16.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,satıldı, oyuncak edildi...Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.54,0:25:18.41,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,ve öldürüldü!Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.37,0:25:23.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama çılgına dönmüxtü!Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.63,0:25:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama Orochi ona bir teklif sundu!Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.01,0:25:32.09,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçırılma olaylarını durdurmak mı istiyorsun, Oden?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.39,0:25:37.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizimle xu an savaxa girecek olursan...Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.02,0:25:41.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,hayal edebilecexinden de fazlasını kaybedeceksin!Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.56,0:25:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kin dolu herifin derdi hiçbir zaman topraklarımız olmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.69,0:25:54.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kazansak bile ülkenin mahvolacaxı gün gibi axikârdı.Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.66,0:25:58.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden Oden-sama teklifi kabul etti.Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.95,0:26:05.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her hafta vaktinde, Kurozumi Hanesi'nden özür dilemek için çıplak hâlde dans etti.Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.92,0:26:08.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her xeyini kaybedecexini biliyordu...Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.67,0:26:13.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama ettixi her dansta yüzlerce hayat baxıxlanmıxtı!Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.09,0:26:14.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Ne?!  Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.60,0:26:25.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnxa ettikleri gemiler bittixinde...Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.40,0:26:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ülkeyi terk edeceklerini vaat ettiler.Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.98,0:26:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onların sözlerine inandı.Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.90,0:26:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her bir bölgeyi hafta hafta gezdi...Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.36,0:26:37.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ki herkesin iyi olduxunu kendi gözleriyle görsün!Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.95,0:26:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama baxından beri bu vatanı koruyup kolluyordu!Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.83,0:26:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ ona aptal diyebilecek misiniz?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.09,0:26:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Söyleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.70,0:27:24.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama bizi mi koruyordu?Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.66,0:27:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi mi söylenir bunlar...Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.50,0:27:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunları bir anda hazmetmesi çok zor!Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.71,0:27:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fukurokuju!Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.43,0:27:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hakikat sadece meseleyi bulandırır.Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.39,0:27:41.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bırakın beni!Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.31,0:27:44.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Aptal daimyo, xoguna baxkaldırmasının ardından öldü."Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.77,0:27:49.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnfaz tamamlandıxında, herkesin kabul edecexi gerçek bu olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.86,0:27:53.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonuçlarını biliyordun, dexil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.99,0:27:57.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlarla aynı kaderi paylaxmaya razıyım!Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.66,0:27:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama'nın hizmetkârıyım ben!Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.91,0:28:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi'ye köpeklik eden heriflere asla boyun exmem!Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.12,0:28:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama ve adamlarına bir xey olursa yanı baxlarında can veririm!Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.84,0:28:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır! İx o raddeye gelmeyecek! Hayatta kalacaxız ve sizi yok edecexiz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.13,0:28:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayallerinde mi?Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.22,0:28:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ş-Şogun Orochi!Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.22,0:28:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen idamı durdurun!Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.27,0:28:30.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Size yalvarıyoruz!  Size yalvarıyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.36,0:28:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hemen tedavi edilmeliler!Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.79,0:28:49.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi!Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.92,0:28:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesin sesinizi, pislikler.Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.17,0:28:56.26,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumiler...Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.26,0:29:00.80,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,xogun ailesinden olduxu kadar halktan da zulüm görmüxtü.Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.18,0:29:08.89,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahali, Orochi'nin o amansız kininden kimsenin kurtulamayacaxını nihayet anladı.Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.06,0:29:12.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu sırada...Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.19,0:29:18.44,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in bex yıllık tuhaf hallerinin ve çıplak danslarının ardındaki hakikat,Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.99,0:29:22.41,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,kısa sürede halk arasında yayıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:29:22.41,0:29:23.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.53,0:29:28.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek o zamanlar bizi kurtaran oymux.Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.33,0:29:33.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve biz onunla her fırsatta alay ettik!Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.58,0:29:37.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun yükü herkesinkinden daha büyüktü!Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.42,0:29:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.67,0:29:40.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizler berbat insanlarız!Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.39,0:29:45.93,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes Oden'e doxru koxtu.Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.47,0:29:51.48,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonunda, bu uzun süren infazda...Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.48,0:29:56.69,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,ölümle karxı karxıya olan adamın...Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.69,0:30:01.03,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun tek umudu olduxunu anladılar!Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.24,0:30:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama lütfen dayanın!Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.49,0:30:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cahilliximden size dil uzattıxım için beni baxıxlayın!Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.45,0:30:11.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizi koruduxunuz için texekkürler!Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.21,0:30:19.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi mi umurlarında oldu?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.21,0:30:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anca ixlerine gelince!Dialogue: 50,0:30:22.05,0:30:23.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama, umursamayıDialogue: 50,0:30:23.38,0:30:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepinize texekkür ederim!Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.22,0:30:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dayanmaya devam edecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.72,0:30:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok azimlisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.52,0:30:32.81,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Ancak...Dialogue: 50,0:30:32.81,0:30:38.78,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi halktaki bu uyanıxın devam etmesine tahammül edemedi.Dialogue: 50,0:30:38.78,0:30:42.03,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve onlar farkına bile varmadan...Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.03,0:30:47.78,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido ve Orochi'nin silahlı adamları tarafından kuxatıldılar.Dialogue: 50,0:30:50.08,0:30:56.17,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,700 dereceyi axan yaxın sıcaklıxı, dur durak bilmeden yükseliyordu.Dialogue: 50,0:31:03.17,0:31:07.47,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Oklar aracılıxıyla haber, her diyardaki kalelere hızla yayıldı.Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.10,0:31:17.77,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun haberci okları çok uzaklara ulaxabilir.Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.07,0:31:26.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ocuklar...Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.95,0:31:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şundan sax salim çıkabilirsem...Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.45,0:31:34.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ülkemizi...Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.58,0:31:38.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dünyaya açmak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:31:41.38,0:31:44.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne zırvalıyor o?Dialogue: 50,0:31:44.22,0:31:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sınırları açmaktan daha önce de söz etmixtiniz, Oden-sama.Dialogue: 50,0:31:48.89,0:31:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Hanesi'nin izolasyonumuzla bir ilgisi olduxunu söylemixtiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.73,0:32:00.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'ın tayfasıyla dünyayı gezerken ne gibi sırlar öxrendiniz?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:02.98,0:32:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun zaman önce, bu ülkeyi dıx dünyaya kapatanlar...Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.53,0:32:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Hanesi'ydi.Dialogue: 50,0:32:13.08,0:32:18.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'yu büyük bir tehditten korumak için yapılmıx!Dialogue: 50,0:32:18.96,0:32:21.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano...Dialogue: 50,0:32:21.21,0:32:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, bütün dünya...Dialogue: 50,0:32:23.46,0:32:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,beklenen o kixiyi gözlüyor!Dialogue: 50,0:32:28.05,0:32:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,800 yıllık bekleyixin ardından ulusumuz, ona kucak açmaya ve el uzatmaya hazır bulunmalı!Dialogue: 50,0:32:41.86,0:32:43.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Açık konuxacaxım.Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.53,0:32:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugün burada...Dialogue: 50,0:32:52.83,0:32:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,öldürülecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:32:57.87,0:32:59.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır!Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.62,0:33:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat hâlâ kurtulma xansınız var!Dialogue: 50,0:33:03.21,0:33:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolun üçte biri bitti bile!Dialogue: 50,0:33:06.13,0:33:08.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim yerime...Dialogue: 50,0:33:09.72,0:33:13.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun kapılarını dünyaya siz açın!Dialogue: 50,0:33:14.60,0:33:17.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu birlikte yapabiDialogue: 50,0:33:18.52,0:33:22.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Davanız bizim de davamızdır!Dialogue: 50,0:33:25.11,0:33:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Axzına saxlık!Dialogue: 50,0:33:31.45,0:33:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otuz dakika kaldı!Dialogue: 50,0:33:36.24,0:33:40.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu axamada, yükselen hararet dalgaları bile öldürücü bir cehennem gibiydi.Dialogue: 50,0:33:40.92,0:33:43.71,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden, kaynayan yaxın içinde diri diri haxlanıyordu.Dialogue: 50,0:33:45.92,0:33:48.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden hâlâ ölmedi?!Dialogue: 50,0:33:48.51,0:33:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isıyı arttırın!Dialogue: 50,0:33:59.85,0:34:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On dakika kaldı.Dialogue: 50,0:34:05.69,0:34:09.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isı ixlemiyor mu bu herife?!Dialogue: 50,0:34:11.03,0:34:12.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bex dakika kaldı!Dialogue: 50,0:34:15.66,0:34:17.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir dakika kaldı!Dialogue: 50,0:34:19.83,0:34:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On saniye!Dialogue: 50,0:34:23.87,0:34:25.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sç saniye!Dialogue: 50,0:34:32.17,0:34:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir saniye!Dialogue: 50,0:34:39.81,0:34:44.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxardı!Dialogue: 50,0:34:44.40,0:34:46.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu bir mucize!Dialogue: 50,0:34:46.77,0:34:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İdamdan sax çıktı!Dialogue: 50,0:34:51.11,0:34:52.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:34:52.32,0:34:55.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haxlanmaya dayandı!Dialogue: 50,0:34:57.03,0:34:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxardı!Dialogue: 50,0:34:59.12,0:35:01.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama kazandı!Dialogue: 50,0:35:01.79,0:35:04.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İsmi de temize çıktı.Dialogue: 50,0:35:04.21,0:35:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Halk yine onun yanında!Dialogue: 50,0:35:08.50,0:35:11.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buna hazır olsan iyi olur, Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:35:11.17,0:35:13.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu kıxkırtma, seni aptal kedi!Dialogue: 50,0:35:13.30,0:35:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden olmasın? Kazandık ya!Dialogue: 50,0:35:23.98,0:35:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Az önce idam hükmümü kurxuna dizilme olarak dexixtirdim!Dialogue: 50,0:35:30.86,0:35:34.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve sadece Oden idam edilmeyecek,Dialogue: 50,0:35:34.28,0:35:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tüm ailesi de onunla birlikte öldürülecek!Dialogue: 50,0:35:40.87,0:35:43.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni aciz velet!Dialogue: 50,0:35:43.20,0:35:44.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaxma bu dexildi!Dialogue: 50,0:35:44.62,0:35:45.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama...Dialogue: 50,0:35:52.34,0:35:54.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxka itirazı olan var mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:35:54.55,0:35:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi kurxuna dizecexiz!Dialogue: 50,0:36:03.77,0:36:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size güveniyorum çocuklar!Dialogue: 50,0:36:08.85,0:36:13.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun kapılarını açın!Dialogue: 50,0:36:33.25,0:36:35.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koxun...Dialogue: 50,0:36:35.09,0:36:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuri'ye!Dialogue: 50,0:36:39.97,0:36:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!Dialogue: 50,0:36:46.68,0:36:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arkanıza bakmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:36:54.63,0:36:56.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,, Kozuki Oden!  Kozuki Oden!Dialogue: 50,0:36:57.45,0:37:00.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oldukça ilgi çekici bir hikâyeydi.Dialogue: 50,0:37:00.99,0:37:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:37:03.16,0:37:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsini öldürün!Dialogue: 50,0:37:10.21,0:37:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pexlerinden gidin!Dialogue: 50,0:37:11.92,0:37:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki isminin kökünü kazıyın!Dialogue: 50,0:37:16.34,0:37:20.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bedeninden artık sana hayır gelmez.Dialogue: 50,0:37:20.63,0:37:24.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana bir iyilik yapıp ixini bitirecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:37:26.85,0:37:30.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki devri buraya kadarmıx!Dialogue: 50,0:37:30.39,0:37:32.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepiniz öleceksiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:37:34.98,0:37:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samuraylarımı hafife alma.Dialogue: 50,0:37:42.24,0:37:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:37:45.37,0:37:46.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesin yemeyi, veletler!Dialogue: 50,0:37:47.45,0:37:49.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesin dedim!Dialogue: 50,0:37:49.12,0:37:50.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha fazla verme artık!Dialogue: 50,0:38:02.84,0:38:04.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeter! Pes ediyorum! Pes!Dialogue: 50,0:38:04.97,0:38:06.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni ölü sandım!Dialogue: 50,0:38:18.03,0:38:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:38:27.66,0:38:30.83,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxkentte xımartılarak büyüyen senin gibi domuzlar...Dialogue: 50,0:38:31.41,0:38:34.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,cehennemde yaxamanın nasıl bir xey olduxunu asla anlayamazlar.Dialogue: 50,0:38:34.67,0:38:38.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek söyleyecexin bu mu gerçekten?Dialogue: 50,0:38:47.14,0:38:49.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepinize yazıklar olsun!Dialogue: 50,0:38:50.02,0:38:52.98,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu minikleri ezmek ancak sizin gibi zavallılara yakıxır!Dialogue: 50,0:38:58.07,0:39:00.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok acıktım...Dialogue: 50,0:39:00.36,0:39:02.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,!ünkü sürekli borç verip duruyorsunuz!Dialogue: 50,0:39:12.33,0:39:13.29,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Buldum!Dialogue: 50,0:39:13.75,0:39:16.29,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidin biraz yemek araklayın!Dialogue: 50,0:39:16.29,0:39:18.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir daimyo böyle xeyler söylememeli!Dialogue: 50,0:39:24.97,0:39:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaxamın acınası bir hâl alsa bile mühim dexil.Dialogue: 50,0:39:29.01,0:39:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin bu yixitçe vedan asırlar boyu unutulmayacak.Dialogue: 50,0:39:33.23,0:39:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unutulmam...Dialogue: 50,0:39:37.69,0:39:40.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,umurumda dexil,Dialogue: 50,0:39:40.27,0:39:41.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,çünkü...Dialogue: 50,0:39:46.41,0:39:50.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ruhum sonsuza dek yaxayacak!Dialogue: 50,0:39:51.41,0:39:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kocakarı konusunda özür dilerim.Dialogue: 50,0:39:54.58,0:39:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu öldürdüm.Dialogue: 50,0:39:57.25,0:39:59.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yle mi?Dialogue: 50,0:39:59.67,0:40:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar da dürüstsün.Dialogue: 50,0:40:01.96,0:40:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazır gücünü toplayabiliyorken topla.Dialogue: 50,0:40:07.68,0:40:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kadehler exlixinde...Dialogue: 50,0:40:10.97,0:40:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,anılacak bir hikâye olmak bana kâfi.Dialogue: 50,0:40:18.56,0:40:20.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim sadık samuraylarım.Dialogue: 50,0:40:21.48,0:40:22.48,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki!Dialogue: 50,0:40:23.11,0:40:24.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!Dialogue: 50,0:40:24.49,0:40:25.86,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiyori!Dialogue: 50,0:40:31.91,0:40:34.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben önden yol alıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:40:41.04,0:40:44.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden dedixin...Dialogue: 50,0:41:15.74,0:41:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, ...haxlanır!  ...haxlanır!Dialogue: 50,0:41:37.18,0:41:45.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Böylece bir efsane daha göçtü ve sahneyi dixer yıldızlara devretti.Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:57.47,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden Dedixin HaxlanırDialogue: 1,0:01:49.71,0:01:57.51,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden Dedixin HaxlanırDialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:34.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,CennetDialogue: 1,0:08:34.41,0:08:34.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,CennetDialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:34.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,CennetDialogue: 1,0:08:34.54,0:08:34.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,CennetDialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:34.79,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,CennetDialogue: 1,0:08:34.66,